      "message": "BlockReader is only going to be used when compiling the programs described by an SkPaintParamsKey, right? With the way it looks up fields and children with O(n) offset calculations, I wouldn\u0027t want it to be something that happened in the draw loop, but I don\u0027t think that\u0027s the case (just struggling to remember the full details).",
