      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right - the BlockReader is how the PaintParamsKey\u0027s data payload is going to be made accessible to the glue code - so only during program construction.\n\nThe painful access method (of recreating the offset each time) need not be permanent. I could see either forcing the glue code to access the fields in order or store the offsets in the key.",
